  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "3C9F1C86B3D9A181",
      "text": "Welcome to the Montenevera Gym! Would you\\nlike me to explain the Gym Test rules again?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "3C9F1986B3D99C68",
      "text": "Your test here at the Montenevera Gym is to\\nwarm up the audience for the main event!\\r\\nThat’s right—you’re the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]opening act[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "3C9F1A86B3D99E1B",
      "text": "You’ll need to get up on stage, show us some\\ndead fierce Pokémon battles, and get the crowd\\r\\nexcited before the Gym Leader’s concert begins!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3C9F1F86B3D9A69A",
      "text": "You can start the Gym Test by speaking with\\nMC Sledge in front of the stage outside.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_01",
      "hash64": "75CFDD5A7E891CA8",
      "text": "Yo, Trainer! You the one performin’ the opening\\nact today? My name’s MC Sledge! This is the\\r\\nstage right here![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_02",
      "hash64": "75CFE05A7E8921C1",
      "text": "So here’s the deal. We’re gonna have you do\\nsome Double Battles! That’s where you have two\\r\\nPokémon fight on each side.[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_03",
      "hash64": "75CFDF5A7E89200E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 55]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0037"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_04",
      "hash64": "75CFE25A7E892527",
      "text": "That’ll let you sledge up double the opponents\\nand get the audience twice as excited! The venue\\r\\nwill be so hot, it’ll melt the Montenevera snow![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_05",
      "hash64": "75CFE15A7E892374",
      "text": "Once you get the audience worked up and ready\\nto go, that’ll be the cue for our leader to take the\\r\\nstage! That’s how you pass our Gym Test, yo![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_19",
      "hash64": "75CC615A7E86141D",
      "text": "Your opening act begins as soon as you get up on\\nstage! There’ll be no backing down until you win\\r\\nthree times in a row, so make sure you’re ready![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_06",
      "hash64": "75CFE45A7E89288D",
      "text": "You good on the deets for the opening act and\\nour Gym Test? Ready to sledge ’em up?![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "DD14BEA998FA3570",
      "text": "Yep! I’m ready!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "DD14C1A998FA3A89",
      "text": "Not yet",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "DD14C0A998FA38D6",
      "text": "Could you explain again?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_no_double",
      "hash64": "3CE24182F9EB5218",
      "text": "Hey now! You’re gonna need two Pokémon for\\nthis Gym Test, yo![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_cancel",
      "hash64": "356C8E8436519EE5",
      "text": "I feel ya. Openin’ for Ryme is no easy task! Make\\nsure you’re ready to go before we start![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_07",
      "hash64": "75CFE35A7E8926DA",
      "text": "Sweet! Just play it by ear—you’ll do great! Head\\non up to the stage![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_20",
      "hash64": "75C8D25A7E82EB49",
      "text": "What’s up, Monteneveraaa! Today’s opening act\\nwill be three back-to-back Double Battles by our\\r\\nchallenger here, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_21",
      "hash64": "75C8D15A7E82E996",
      "text": "And the first of their three opponents will be a\\nyoung performer who makes it look like a breeze![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_30",
      "hash64": "75C54C5A7E7FD1C0",
      "text": "The one, the only...Tas![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_boy_01",
      "hash64": "8DEC4E6B5ECC8FBA",
      "text": "Double Battles—that means one plus one, right?\\nCan you do that math?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
