    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "A6867CAD00457FC3",
      "text": "The audience’s cheering got a little louder!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_22",
      "hash64": "75C8D05A7E82E7E3",
      "text": "The Montenevera stage has all the latest tech!\\nThe more excited the audience gets, the more\\r\\nthe stage will light up![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_23",
      "hash64": "75C8CF5A7E82E630",
      "text": "Keep on sledgin’! You got this![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_24",
      "hash64": "75C8D65A7E82F215",
      "text": "Aaand our challenger’s next opponent will be a\\nmusician with a bit of a unique style...[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_25",
      "hash64": "75C8D55A7E82F062",
      "text": "Iiit’s Lani![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_musician_01",
      "hash64": "FA28AE5C2161A7D7",
      "text": "Strong complements weak! The harmony of two\\nPokémon battling in unison!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_02",
      "hash64": "A6867DAD00458176",
      "text": "The audience is really getting excited!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_26",
      "hash64": "75C8D45A7E82EEAF",
      "text": "Your opening act’s turned the cheering AND the\\nstage lighting up to 11![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_27",
      "hash64": "75C8D35A7E82ECFC",
      "text": "What a surprise from our new challenger! Who’d\\nhave thought they’d sledge it up this much?![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_28",
      "hash64": "75C8DA5A7E82F8E1",
      "text": "Next is your last opponent. And it’s none other\\nthan...[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_29",
      "hash64": "75C8D95A7E82F72E",
      "text": "ME! MC Sledge![VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
