      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_18",
      "hash64": "75CC605A7E86126A",
      "text": "Give us a min for some Ryme time, ya feel me?\\nGo ahead and tell the lobby staffer you passed.[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
